{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24902","headline":"暮春自南台丞再除给事中 · 薛存诚","name":"暮春自南台丞再除给事中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再入青锁闱，忝官诚自非。\n拂尘惊物在，开户似僧归。\n积草渐无迳，残花犹洒衣。\n禁垣偏日近，行坐是恩辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}